@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
title YouRun · 启动、停止与状态同步
actor 用户 as User
participant "React / ViewModel" as UI
participant "desktop.Host" as Host
participant "workspace.Service" as Workspace
database SQLite as DB
participant "engine.Client" as Client
collections "执行文件 / 日志" as Files
participant "独立执行器" as Worker
participant "Shell / 命令树" as Shell
User -> UI : 启动命令
UI -> UI : flush() 等待定义保存
UI -> Host : POST /api/run（新运行 ID）
Host -> Workspace : Request
Workspace -> DB : 读取已保存命令
Workspace -> Client : 提交不可变 Execution
Client -> Client : 校验 / 幂等 / 并发检查
Client -> Files : 原子发布 manifest.json + state.json
Client -> Worker : 启动当前程序 _execute
Worker -> Files : 持有 owner.lock；写入 WorkerPID
Client -> Files : 读取启动确认
Client --> Workspace : Run（已接收）
Workspace --> Host : Run
Host --> UI : Run
Worker -> Shell : 启动并持有进程控制句柄
Shell -> Files : stdout / stderr 直接追加日志
opt 用户请求停止
  User -> UI : 停止
  UI -> Host : POST /api/stop
  Host -> Workspace : 转发请求
  Workspace -> Client : Stop(id)
  Client -> Files : 写 stop.json
  Worker -> Files : 读取停止请求
  Worker -> Shell : 停止进程组
end
Shell --> Worker : 命令树退出
Worker -> Files : 写最终 state.json
Worker -> Worker : 释放锁并退出
Files --> Host : 文件变化通知（fsnotify）
Host -> Workspace : 重新读取运行状态
Workspace -> Client : State()
Client -> Files : 读取执行记录
Client --> Workspace : RuntimeState
Workspace -> DB : SyncRuntime + Snapshot
Workspace --> Host : 已提交快照
Host --> UI : SSE snapshot / patch
note over Host, Worker
  时序为成功主路径；启动确认与 Shell 启动可交错
  GUI 退出不会隐式停止独立执行器或命令
end note
@enduml
